      48.81,
      408.73,
      539.91,
      443.8
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (2) of Section 1 of the Assistance to and Protection of Victims of Crimeand Witnesses Act, No. 4 of 2015, I, Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, Minister of Justice, do by this Order appoint May 18, 2016, tobe the date on which the provisions of Parts I, II, III, IV, V, VI, VII, VIII and IX of the aforesaid Act shall come into operation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
