    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      456.73,
      539.87,
      491.8
    ],
    "text": "The order made under Sub-section (2) of Section 1 of the Assistance to and Protection of Victims of Crime andWitnesses Act, No. 4 of 2015 and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1926/51 dated 7th August, 2015 is herebyrescinded.",
